],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 36 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle had October to November at 60% and November to December at 40%. So far in 2026 the middle shows January to February at 54% and February to March at 58%. Grid 17552 had its driest year in 1963 at 60%.</p>"}
